@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Dynamic Schema Inference and Form Lifecycle (FormGenerator & EditFormGenerator)

actor "User" as User
participant "EditFormGenerator" as FormView
participant "buildFieldsFromEntity" as SchemaInfer
participant "useForm (React Hook Form)" as HookForm
participant "FormInput" as AtomicInput
participant "Backend REST API" as Backend

== 1. Entity Loading and Schema Inference ==

User -> FormView: Opens edit form with entityToEdit (or via URL route)
activate FormView

opt entityToEdit is null (Deferred load via URL)
    FormView -> Backend: GET /api/v1/resource/{id}
    Backend --> FormView: 200 OK [JSON with entity attributes]
end

FormView -> SchemaInfer: buildFieldsFromEntity(entity, selectOptions, fieldConfig)
activate SchemaInfer
SchemaInfer --> FormView: fields: FieldDef[]
deactivate SchemaInfer
note right of SchemaInfer
  Dynamic schema inference from in-memory object.
  Filters primary key and deduces input types (select, text, number, etc.).
  See activity diagram:
  "15_Flow_buildFieldsFromEntity_EditFormGenerator"
end note

== 2. Uncontrolled State Initialization ==

FormView -> HookForm: useForm<T>({ defaultValues: entity })
activate HookForm
HookForm --> FormView: { register, handleSubmit, formState: { errors, isSubmitting } }
deactivate HookForm

loop For each field in fields: FieldDef[]
    FormView -> AtomicInput: Render FormInput(field, register, errors)
    AtomicInput -> AtomicInput: Binds uncontrolled ref via register(name)
end

== 3. Client-Side Data Editing ==

User -> AtomicInput: Inputs text and modifies controls
note right AtomicInput
  React Hook Form manages inputs via uncontrolled references,
  optimizing form re-renders.
end note

== 4. Submission, Validation, and Persistence ==

User -> FormView: Clicks "Save" / Submit button
FormView -> HookForm: handleSubmit(onSubmit)(event)
activate HookForm

alt Form contains validation errors
    HookForm -> FormView: Updates formState.errors
    FormView -> AtomicInput: Displays error messages in red under affected fields
else Form is valid
    HookForm -> FormView: Invokes callback onSubmit(formData)
    deactivate HookForm
    
    FormView -> Backend: PUT /api/v1/resource/{id} [Payload: serialized JSON]
    activate Backend
    Backend --> FormView: 200 OK [Updated entity]
    deactivate Backend
    
    FormView -> User: Displays confirmation or redirects to table
end

deactivate FormView

@enduml
